  "bo_system": "Idox Uniform",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of its excessive scale, height and proximity to the southern boundary with 13 Fir Tree Grove, would appear as an unduly dominant and visually overbearing addition when viewed from the neighbouring dwelling and garden. The development would result in a significant loss of outlook and a heightened sense of enclosure for the occupiers of 13 Fir Tree Grove, to the detriment of their living conditions. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy 29 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "The applicant has failed to submit an acoustic assessment or provide details of any noise mitigation measures to demonstrate that the proposed use of the hall, including activities such as singing, amplified music and the operation of plant or ventilation equipment, could be undertaken without causing noise disturbance to neighbouring occupiers. In the absence of such information, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the development would safeguard the amenity of nearby residents. The proposal is therefore contrary to policies 29 and 34 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018."
  ],
